<title>USA: First American ups qtly dividend 29 pct.</title>
<headline>First American ups qtly dividend 29 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NASHVILLE, Tenn. 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>First American Corp said Thursday its board of directors approved a two-for-one stock split and a 29-percent increase in its quarterly dividend.</p>
<p>The stock split will be issued on May 9 to shareholders of record on April 28.</p>
<p>On a pre-split basis, the quarterly dividend will be increased from $0.31 per share to $0.40 per share. The dividend will be payable May 30 to shareholders of record on May 15, the company said.</p>
</text>
